{"text": "INVOICE\nBrightwater Design Studio LLC\n\n418 Magnolia Court, Studio B\n\nSt. Petersburg, FL 33701\n\n(727) 555-0114 / billing@brightwaterdesign.example\n\nEIN 59-3310847 (Form W-9 available on request)\n\nInvoice no. BW-2026-0142\nInvoice date Feb 3, 2026\nDue date Mar 5, 2026\nTerms Net 30\nYour PO 4471-B\n\nBill to:\n\nOsei Family Dentistry, P.A.\n\nAttn: Dr. Samuel Osei-Bonsu\n\n2750 Fourth Street North, Suite 110\n\nSt. Petersburg, FL 33704\n\nServices, January 2026 (Phase 2: website and patient forms)\nDescription Qty Rate Amount\nWeb design 22 h $135.00 $2,970.00\nCopywriting 9 h $95.00 $855.00\nPhoto session 1 $650.00 $650.00\nStock images 6 $12.50 $75.00\nSubtotal $4,550.00\nSales tax $5.25\nDeposit paid ($1,500.00)\nBalance due $3,055.25\n\nHow to pay\nOnline: https://pay.brightwaterdesign.example/i/BW-2026-0142\n\nACH: Gulf Coast Commerce Bank, routing 072842966, account 000123886041.\n\nInternational wire: IBAN IE60AIBK90660631872110, reference the invoice\nnumber.\n\nCard on file: the Visa ending 9031 (exp. 11/27) will be charged on the due date\nunless Priscilla in your office tells us otherwise.\n\nNotes\nDr. Osei-Bonsu, the photo session on January 17 covered you and the two\nhygienists only; Dr. Achterberg was out. We can add her portrait at no charge\nwhen she is back from maternity leave. Past-due balances accrue a late charge of\n1.5% per month.\n\nQuestions: Lucía Montoya, studio manager, lucia@brightwaterdesign.example,\n727.555.0162.\n\nThank you for your business.", "kind": "PDF", "detail": "2 pages · 212 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Osei Family Dentistry, P.A.", "Dr. Samuel Osei-Bonsu", "Dr. Achterberg", "Priscilla", "Lucía Montoya"], "companies": ["Brightwater Design Studio LLC", "Gulf Coast Commerce Bank"]}, "chunks": 1, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 150.09999999776483, "modelMs": 13228.199999999255, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "phone", "dob